# Gypsy Fortune Teller

## Lore

The Gypsy Fortune Teller, or Gypsy Medium, is a master psionic who reads palms,
senses supernatural evil, and sees through the disguise of anything that is
wearing one. That last power arrives unbidden - a shadow caught from the corner
of the eye showing a creature''s true shape, or an omen: a flower falling when
brushed by a disguised demon of death, a baby waking in screams when a Kaluga
Hag''s shadow crosses it, a cracked egg where a Deathless One has passed.

She is also on terms with the Woodland Spirits. They treat her as a kindred
spirit and a potential comrade, share news and food, and come to her defence -
provided she does the same for them. Even the murderous ones treat these women
as equals.

## Alignment

Any, although most are scrupulous, unprincipled or anarchist.

## GM Notes

Only 6% of Gypsy Mediums are literate in any language - the lowest rate in a
book full of low ones, and lower even than the Gypsy Seer''s 10%.

Her spell list is drawn from three different Russian traditions at once: Nature
Magic, the Necromancer''s Bone Magic, and the Fire Sorcerer''s Living Fire. She is
the only class in the book that reaches across all three.
', 'published', 'data-script'
